## Icons & Desktop Integration

### Window Icon (`mainwindow.py:56`)
`QIcon.fromTheme('lazarus')` first (XDG `~/.local/share/icons/hicolor/`), fallback to bundled `lazarus/icons/hicolor/1024x1024/apps/lazarus.png` shipped as `package_data`. No SVG — all sizes from PNG set.

### Desktop Entry (`app.py:install_desktop`)
`lazarus --install-desktop` copies bundled PNGs to `~/.local/share/icons/hicolor/` and writes embedded `_DESKTOP_ENTRY` to `~/.local/share/applications/lazarus.desktop`, then `update-desktop-database`. One-shot explicit step — pipx cannot install `data_files` automatically; system packaging uses `setup.py:data_files`.

## Key Bindings

All `global_keymap` keys delegate via `Dodo.delegate_to_list` / `delegate_to_thread` / direct `Dodo` methods, so they work regardless of focus. `search_keymap`/`thread_keymap` are empty dicts kept for `config.py` overrides.

### Navigation (global)
| Key | Action |
|-----|--------|
| `j` / `k` / `↓` / `↑` | Next/previous thread (`navigate_list`) |
| `<tab>` / `S-<tab>` | Next/previous unread thread |
| `J` / `K` | Next/previous message in thread preview |
| `g g` / `G` | First/last thread |
| `M-j` / `M-k` | Down/up 20 threads |
| `<pageup>` / `<pagedown>` | Page up/down (list) |
| `<space>` / `-` | Page down/up (message) |
| `<enter>` | Open thread in preview (`open_current_thread`) |
| `<escape>` | Focus list (`focus_list`) |
| `C-<enter>` | Close thread preview (`clear_thread`) |
| `h` / `l` | Previous/next tab (`previous_panel`/`next_panel`) |
| `x` / `X` | Close panel / close all |

### Actions (global → list)
| Key | Action |
|-----|--------|
| `s` | Mark thread and advance (`mark_and_advance`) |
| `a` | Archive current/marked (`archive_thread` → `-inbox -unread`) |
| `d` | Delete to trash (current/marked → `+trash` + move to `[Gmail]/Trash`) |
| `d d` | Empty trash (`expunge_trash`, irreversible) |
| `d u` | Restore from trash |
| `A` | Archive to local Maildir (`~/Mail/Archive`) |
| `u` / `f` | Toggle `unread`/`flagged` (`toggle_thread_tag`) |
| `t t` | Tag current thread (`tag_bar`) |
| `t m` | Tag all marked threads (`tag_bar mode='tag marked'`) |
| `t h` | Theme picker (`theme_bar` — command bar in `theme` mode, name autocomplete) |
| `1`–`9` | Toggle `tag_hotkeys` tag |

### Global / Views
| Key | Action |
|-----|--------|
| `?` | Help (`HelpWindow`, three-column HTML) |
| `c` | Compose (`open_compose`) |
| `I` | Show inbox (`tag:inbox`) |
| `U` | Show unread (`tag:inbox and tag:unread`) |
| `F` | Show flagged (`tag:flagged`) |
| `T` | Tag browser (`open_tags`) |
| `/` | Search bar (`search_bar`) |
| `C-/` | Edit current tab query in-place (`edit_search_query`) |
| `` ` `` | Manual sync (`sync_mail quiet=False`) |
| `C-r` | Apply filter rules (`apply_filter_rules`) |
| `M-<` / `M->` | Previous/next theme (`cycle_theme`; Alt — `C-<` collides with the `C-<enter>` chord prefix) |
| `Q` | Quit (`prompt_quit`, respects dirty panels/`keep_open`) |

### Thread View (global → thread preview)
| Key | Action |
|-----|--------|
| `H` | Toggle HTML/plaintext |
| `i` | Toggle remote images |
| `M` | Toggle list mode (conversation ↔ tree) |
| `r` / `R` | Reply all / reply — focused context: preview's current message, or the list's selected thread (most recent email) |
| `C-y` | Forward — same focused-context rule |
| `O` | Open attachments (dump to temp dir → file browser) |

### Thread View — message-level actions (Ctrl-variants act on the selected
message in the preview; the plain keys above act on the whole thread)
| Key | Action |
|-----|--------|
| `C-u` | Toggle `unread` on the current message |
| `C-f` | Toggle `flagged` on the current message |
| `C-a` | Archive current message (`-inbox -unread`) |
| `C-A` | Archive current message to local Maildir |
| `C-d` | Move current message to Trash |
| `C-t` | Tag current message (modal, `+` prefilled) |

### Tag Panel (`tag_keymap`)
`j`/`k`/`↓`/`↑`, `g g`/`G`, `M-k`/`M-j`, `<enter>` (search tag).

### Compose (`compose_keymap`)
| Key | Action |
|-----|--------|
| `<escape>` | Toggle focus (editor ↔ chrome) |
| `<enter>` | Insert newline (when editor focused) |
| `H` | Toggle plaintext compose (chrome focus; Shift+H — mirrors the reading view's HTML toggle). Plain mode: formatting stripped, outgoing message has no HTML part; toolbar formatting buttons disabled, `Plain` shown in the status area |
| `C-s` | Send (`SendmailThread`, disables UI, status on error) |
| `M-c` / `M-b` | Toggle hidden Cc / Bcc row: reveal + focus, or hide — content in a hidden row is disregarded on send but remembered (re-reveal restores it) |
| `a` | Attach file (file picker or `file_picker_command`) |
| `[` / `]` | Previous/next SMTP account (cycles the From dropdown too, reloads sig) |
| `p` / `e` | Toggle PGP sign/encrypt |

### Command Bar (`command_bar_keymap`)
`<enter>` accept, `<escape>` close, `<down>`/`<up>` history.

## Configuration

Config is a Python file at `~/.config/lazarus/config.py` located via `QStandardPaths` and `exec()`'d at startup. All settings in `lazarus.settings` with documented defaults; `email_address` + `sent_dir` are required.

### Required
| Setting | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| `email_address` | `str` or `{account: address}` dict; From + reply-all self-filter |
| `sent_dir` | `str` or `{account: dir}` dict; Maildir sent folder (or `None` to discard) |

### Key Optional
| Setting | Default | Purpose |
|---------|---------|---------|
| `theme` | `themes.nord` | Palette dict; `apply_theme()` at startup; `M-<`/`M->`/`t h` switch live (QSettings `last_theme_name` remembered across launches) |
| `theme_overrides` | `{}` | `{theme_name: {key: value}}` manual mapping on top of the heuristic terminal-theme mapping; special key `'*'` applies to every pack theme (replaces the heuristic), per-theme entries run after and win — value can be a hex color, an ANSI palette index of the source theme (`'fg_subject_unread': 3`), a named terminal color (`'fg_tags': 'foreground'`), or another Lazarus key (`'fg_date': 'fg_dim'`) |
| `colormap.py` | (file) | `~/.config/lazarus/themes/colormap.py` — auto-created on first run, never overwritten; documents all 19 color keys + the built-in heuristic (generated from `DEFAULT_TERMINAL_MAP`, no drift), exec'd at startup and merged per-key over config.py's `theme_overrides` (this file wins) |
| `sync_mail_command` | `'offlineimap'` | Fallback shell sync when `smtp_accounts` empty |
| `sync_mail_interval` | `300` | Auto-sync secs; `-1` disables |
| `send_mail_command` | `'msmtp -a "{account}" -t'` | `str` or `{account: cmd}`; `{account}` placeholder |
| `smtp_accounts` | `['default']` | Account names; drives parallel `mbsync -V` + compose switch |
| `file_browser_command` | `"nautilus '{dir}'"` | Attachment viewer; `{dir}` temp dir |
| `file_picker_command` | `None` | Optional picker; `{tempfile}` out list |
| `web_browser_command` | `''` | Empty → desktop default |
| `init_queries` | `['tag:inbox']` | Non-closable startup tabs (`keep_open=True`) |
| `mail_root` | `'~/Mail'` | Maildir root; Trash/Archive resolution base |
| `archive_dir` | `'~/Mail/Archive'` | Local archive dest |
| `thread_pane_position` | `'right'` | `right/left/below/above` → splitter orientation |
| `force_dark_mode` | `True` | Sets `QTWEBENGINE_CHROMIUM_FLAGS --force-dark-mode` before web view init |
| `default_to_html` | `False` | Thread view HTML default |
| `wrap_message` | `True` | Plaintext wrap |
| `wrap_column` | `78` | Wrap width |
| `remove_temp_dirs` | `'ask'` | `always/never/ask` attachment temp cleanup |
| `gnupg_home` / `gnupg_keyid` | `None` | PGP home/key |
| `filter_rules` | `[]` | `List[Rule]` — auto after sync + `C-r` |
| `filter_scope_query` | `'tag:inbox and tag:unread'` | Scopes rules as `(scope) and (rule.query)` |
| `tag_hotkeys` | `{}` | `{'1':'Urgent',...}` → `1-9` toggles |
| `tag_icons` | `{inbox,unread,attachment,sent,replied,flagged,marked,signed}` | NerdFont icons |
| `nerd_font` | `''` | NerdFont family for toolbar/dropdown-arrow glyphs; empty = auto-pick installed `* Nerd Font`, else `tag_font` |
| `tag_order` | `['marked','Urgent',...]` | Tag display priority |
| `hide_tags` | `['unread','sent']` | Hidden in search tag column |
| `log_level` | `'WARNING'` | `DEBUG/INFO/WARNING/ERROR/CRITICAL` |
| `log_file` | `''` | Empty → stderr only |
| `html_block_remote_requests` | `True` | Block remote HTML resources |
| `html_confirm_open_links` | `True` | Confirm before opening browser |
| `html_confirm_open_links_trusted_hosts` | `[]` | Bypass confirm for hosts |
| `use_signature` | `True` | Per-account sig insertion |
| `search_font`/`search_font_size` | `DejaVu Sans Mono`/`13` | Search/list/tag fonts |
| `tag_font`/`tag_font_size` | `DejaVu Sans Mono`/`13` | |
| `message_font`/`message_font_size` | `DejaVu Sans Mono`/`12` | Plaintext viewer |
| `compose_editor_font/size` | `DejaVu Sans Mono`/`12` | Compose editor |
| `search_view_padding` | `1` | Row spacing |
| `search_title_format` | `"{query} [{num_threads}]"` | Tab titles |
| `search_color_overrides` | `{}` | `{tag:{col:color}}` per-column overrides |
| `message_css` | `pre/body/a/scrollbar` | Theme-aware CSS (`{bg,fg,fg_dim,fg_bright,bg_button}`) |
| `message2html_filters` | `[]` | Custom renderers `(msg→HTML|None)` |

### Per-Account Signatures (`signature.py`)
`$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/lazarus/<account>/signature` (text) + `signature.html` (HTML, optional) per `smtp_accounts` entry. Swapped on `[`/`]` account cycle; HTML downconverted via `html2text` until rich compose uses it directly.

## Ruly's Setup
- **Mail**: `~/Mail/` — Gmail (`RulyTafzil@gmail.com/`) + `contact@RulyTafzil.com`
- **Sync**: `mbsync -a -V` per account in parallel (`synchronize_flags=true`), fallback `sync_mail_command`
- **Send**: `msmtp` with `gmail` + `contact` accounts
- **Theme**: Nord
- **Editor**: n/a (built-in `RichTextEditor` is the only compose editor; external `$EDITOR` flow removed Aug 2026)
- **Notmuch**: `post-new` hook maps folders→tags, strips Trash/Spam tags

## Development

- **Run**: `lazarus` (or `python -m lazarus`); editable `pipx install -e .`
- **Type check**: `mypy lazarus` — **clean (0 errors)**; `disallow_untyped_defs = True`; keep it green
- **Tests**: 225 tests in `tests/` — `python -m pytest` from the repo root (pytest injected into the lazarus-mail pipx venv). Pure logic + offscreen Qt (Tiers 1+2): notmuch stubbed, QSettings redirected to tmp, `lazarus.settings` restored per test (see `tests/conftest.py`). No WebEngine construction in tests (segfaults offscreen — models are covered, panels aren't).
- **Logs**: `settings.log_level='DEBUG'` + `log_file='~/.local/share/lazarus/lazarus.log'`
- **Conventions**: file headers keep original `Aleks Kissinger` copyright for Dodo-derived code; Lazarus-new files carry Ruly header. Keep `key_string` / `message_css` / `LOCAL_PROTOCOLS` stable — they are part of the public `config.py` surface.
- **Adding keys**: add to `keymap.global_keymap` (or `tag_keymap`/`compose_keymap`/`command_bar_keymap`); local `search_keymap`/`thread_keymap` exist only for user overrides.
- **PR workflow (Aug 2026)**: feature branches `pr/<slug>` → Forgejo API PRs (see forgejo-git skill) → merge+prune in order, rebasing downstream branches as they go. 8-PR cleanup series (mypy 182→0, protocols, perf, latent bugs) + test suite + features (message-level actions, list reply/forward, compose Cc/Bcc toggles) merged; each PR's description carries its verification notes.
- **Aug 2026 cleanup (pr/refactor-cleanup)**: dead code + unused imports removed (incl. all `from . import app` runtime imports — app.py no longer imports panel modules), Dodo shim layer deleted (AppController is the sole `PanelApp` implementer), duplication consolidated (`notmuch.show_part`, `util.sort_tags`, `_cycle_account`, single `_parse_address_list`), Qt star imports → explicit. Net −149 LOC, 158 tests, mypy 0. 
- **Aug 2026 (pr/cleanup-style-editor)**: shared `style.cell_font`/`theme_color` (memoised, used by all three list/tree models), `ThreadItem.row_in_parent` → O(1) `ThreadModel.parent`, file-browser fallback in argv form (no shell), `sanitize_filename` comment; **external-editor flow removed** — `EditorThread`, `editor_command`, compose `E` key, and the raw-message round-trip all deleted (built-in `RichTextEditor` is the only compose editor).
- **Aug 2026 (pr/compose-labels-toolbar)**: compose fields get real left labels (To/Cc/Bcc/Subject, right-aligned, fixed width so boxes align; placeholders dropped); `RichTextEditor.formatting_toolbar()` — compact strip (B/I/U checkables synced to cursor format, exclusive align group, bullet/numbered lists, text-colour dialog, insert-image dialog); all buttons NoFocus so keyboard focus stays in the editor.
- **Aug 2026 (pr/compose-labels-toolbar follow-ups)**: polish — 2px right margins on field rows, toolbar left-aligned/content-sized with reduced vertical padding, header font one point smaller than body; **From row** — old account/from header bar replaced by a labeled `From:` dropdown (one item per `smtp_accounts`, address text, account-name prefix when addresses collide, CSS-triangle arrow), PGP/send status moved into the row's right side, `[`/`]` still cycle and keep the combo selection in sync via a single guarded `_set_account(idx)`; From moved to the top of the field stack; **NerdFont icons** — toolbar buttons and the dropdown arrow use NerdFont glyphs (Font Awesome codepoints, auto-picked family via `settings.nerd_font`, arrow rendered to a temp PNG for QSS `image:` since Qt QSS can't use font glyphs).
- **Aug 2026 (pr/compose-plaintext-mode)**: compose **plaintext mode** — `RichTextEditor.toggle_plain()` (Shift+H in compose chrome, or the toolbar's `[Plaintext | HTML]` segmented toggle at the far left — two exclusive checkable buttons in a bordered box, active segment filled, click switches mode; QML Switch rejected as non-trivial + wrong shape): strips formatting in place (fresh char format), disables the formatting buttons, and makes `body_html()`/`collect_inline_images()` no-op so the outgoing message takes `build_message`'s plaintext-only path (bare `text/plain`, no HTML part). Status area shows `Plain`; toolbar sync runs once at build so the HTML segment is highlighted on open. `body_text()` now strips Qt's U+FFFC image placeholder char.
- **Aug 2026 (pr/fix-thread-swap-race)**: `_SwapGuard` in thread.py arbitrates the double-buffer view swap — rapid H/i toggling (or fast message nav) left several web loads in flight and the old code swapped on every `loadFinished`, so a stale completion could flip back to old content and stacked connections could double-swap. Guard rules: only the newest request may swap, each request swaps at most once, and a scheduled swap is void if superseded before its deferred timer runs. `refresh_content` also disconnects before reconnecting so connections stay bounded at one per view. Verified: 5 pure-logic unit tests (test_swap_guard.py) + standalone offscreen WebEngine check (13 rapid loads → exactly one swap to the newest request).
- **Aug 2026 (master, post-.agent)**: watermark title + low-poly geometric tab-strip background (`WatermarkTabWidget`, `mainwindow.py`) — mesh/title painted from theme colors, opacity tuned; `images/` (old dodo screenshots) removed.
- **Aug 2026 (pr/theme-import-switching)**: **terminal-style theme import + live theme switching**. `themes.py` gains `_validate_terminal_entry`/`terminal_theme_to_lazarus` (16-ANSI heuristic mapping → Lazarus keys, dark/light aware), `load_theme_pack` (JSON list, per-entry error tolerance), `build_registry()` (hand-written Python themes > bundled `theme_packs/builtin.json` — 602 iTerm2-shape themes ~350KB > `~/.config/lazarus/themes/*.json` user packs > `settings.theme_overrides` per-key corrections) and `REGISTRY`. Live switching: `set_theme`/`cycle_theme`/`ordered_names`/`current_name`/`ThemeError`, `M-<`/`M->` cycle keys, `t h` command-bar picker (theme-name autocomplete), QSettings `last_theme_name` remembered across launches (`resolve_initial_theme` prefers it over config default), `style.py` caches self-invalidate via `settings.theme` rebind (new dict id), watermark mesh invalidated on switch. `app.py` builds REGISTRY after config.py runs; `setup.py`/`MANIFEST.in` ship `theme_packs/*.json`. Tests: 19 in test_theme_import.py (mapping/validation/pack-loading/priority/overrides) + controller theme tests. Note: quit key is `Q` (the temporary `C-q` from 0b05e36 was reverted; `C-<` theme-cycle rejected — collides with the `C-<enter>` chord prefix, hence Alt).
- **Aug 2026 (pr/theme-import-switching fixes)**: `_TagLoader` teardown race fixed — per-bar parented QThread crashed at teardown (“Destroyed while thread is still running”); now a process-wide `_TagStore` owns the loader (fetch per idle period, broadcast via shared `loaded` signal, finished loaders replaced not destroyed). `lazarus/__init__.py` restored to the re-export shim (had been clobbered by a copy of keymap.py — `import lazarus; lazarus.settings` silently broke). `test_compose_model.py` restored (9 compose_model tests — had been overwritten with AppController tests; those live in test_controller.py, which also gained the 4 keypress theme tests). mypy back to 0 (incl. `QPaintEvent | None` override); unused imports dropped; stale transfer zips (`files.zip`) removed. **Theme-key contract**: every theme must define `THEME_KEYS` (19 keys — the full set the app reads; the terminal mapping emits all of them, pinned by test_theme_import.py so an incomplete mapping can't ship again); `style.theme_color_or()` degrades gracefully for minimal user-supplied theme dicts.
- **Linter**: `pyflakes lazarus` (pipx venv) should stay clean apart from the intentional re-exports in `lazarus/__init__.py` and `lazarus/util.py`.
